-- shape_broken.grant -- a sentence of grants_v32.haro: WANTS written as a word where a list belongs (line 8); the structural court refuses it, and no pattern judges what it refused.

DEFINE ZONE ops AS (
  RIGHTS [read]
) RATIONALE "The operations zone grants reading"

DEFINE USE report AS (
  WANTS read
) RATIONALE "A report whose WANTS is no list"
